From fbaf0edec140d83550b0e324fda76f1f7482544d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Feb 2026 23:23:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix giant social icons on mobile and broken CSS loading

Root cause: docs/ was built with `hugo server` (dev mode), causing all
internal URLs to point to http://localhost:1314/. This meant custom.css
never loaded in production, leaving SVG social icons completely unsized.

Fixes:
- Replace all localhost:1314 URLs with https://danielfiuza.com in docs/
- Remove livereload script injection from generated HTML
- Remove duplicate UIKit 3.6.18 (head.html already loads 3.17.11)
- Consolidate conflicting social icon CSS rules (3 duplicate definitions)
- Remove dangerous `a { display: flex }` rule that affected all links
- Bump CSS cache version to v=3

https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mpr4KjCsPD8zgsoogrhhTR
