       <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;daniel-fiuza&#34;&gt;Daniel Fiuza&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; at Range.org with a &lt;strong&gt;PhD from Imperial College London&lt;/strong&gt;. I build ML systems for blockchain security and compliance—protecting $30B+ in monitored assets across 21 integrated chains.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;what-i-do&#34;&gt;What I Do&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🔗 &lt;strong&gt;Blockchain ML&lt;/strong&gt;: Risk detection and anomaly analysis for DeFi protocols&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Stablecoin Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;: USDC cross-chain monitoring and KYT/AML systems&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;�️ &lt;strong&gt;Security Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;: Real-time threat detection for blockchain networks&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🔬 &lt;strong&gt;Research&lt;/strong&gt;: ML for biomarker discovery at Imperial College London&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;current-focus&#34;&gt;Current Focus&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Data Scientist at Range.org&lt;/strong&gt; — building ML-powered compliance and security solutions for blockchain infrastructure. Monitoring $30B+ in assets across cross-chain transactions, USDC bridges, and DeFi protocols. Also serving as Research Associate at Imperial College London, applying ML for biomarker discovery in clinical immunology trials.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
